Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":252,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1904827,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283605,"Name":"SJ10YearVowRenewal","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283605.jpg?_r=1435663320","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1442355502,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":7,"Preview":{"Id":1904827,"PostDate":1442355502,"PostContent":"Maybe I am being lazy but if someone one could tell me if \u00a0there is an app or website that perfor...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sjnewme@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.116.36.205","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434635893,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283605.jpg?_r=1435663320","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SJ10YearVowRenewal","Id":283605,"Name":"SJ10YearVowRenewal","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.238.180","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79592,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ff0b342f242782e60c9b57b8b5020b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Maybe I am being lazy but if someone one could tell me if &amp;nbsp;there is an app or website that performs the following, I would be in your debt forever.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I need an app or website that will :&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. Pull my contacts from my email systems (Gmail, Yahoo etc)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. Pull my contacts from Facebook.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. It will pull both email and address (if noted)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. It will then allow me to select the individuals to recieve a message.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5. I can create a custom message, asking the user to update or add their mailing address.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;6. It then allows me to send one message to the user&#039;s email or phone (as a text).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;7. User can then click on link in text or email and updates their contact information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;8. I now have an updated list w\/o the hassle of asking everyone constantly to update lists.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Am I in la la land? Does this exist?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904827,"PostDate":1442355502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Maybe I am being lazy but if someone one could tell me if \u00a0there is an app or website that performs the following, I would be in your debt forever.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I need an app or website that will :<\/p>\n<p>1. Pull my contacts from my email systems (Gmail, Yahoo etc)<\/p>\n<p>2. Pull my contacts from Facebook.<\/p>\n<p>3. It will pull both email and address (if noted)<\/p>\n<p>4. It will then allow me to select the individuals to recieve a message.<\/p>\n<p>5. I can create a custom message, asking the user to update or add their mailing address.<\/p>\n<p>6. It then allows me to send one message to the user's email or phone (as a text).\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>7. User can then click on link in text or email and updates their contact information.<\/p>\n<p>8. I now have an updated list w\/o the hassle of asking everyone constantly to update lists.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Am I in la la land? Does this exist?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sjnewme@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.116.36.205","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434635893,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283605.jpg?_r=1435663320","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SJ10YearVowRenewal","Id":283605,"Name":"SJ10YearVowRenewal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79592,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b846b582be76af8cc26c98384ea70c27","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t know if you&#039;re using an iphone or an android based device but there are several different apps available on both. I really don&#039;t know if you could get it to do everything you&#039;re asking for but it might manage to do part of it. Best thing is look in the App store for the device you have, type in \"wedding\" and read through what pops up. That&#039;s what I did and found the very basic app that I wanted (our guest list is 4 so not a big deal).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904855,"PostDate":1442400675,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I don't know if you're using an iphone or an android based device but there are several different apps available on both. I really don't know if you could get it to do everything you're asking for but it might manage to do part of it. Best thing is look in the App store for the device you have, type in \"wedding\" and read through what pops up. That's what I did and found the very basic app that I wanted (our guest list is 4 so not a big deal).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79592","Title":"Creating\/updating A Guest List - Isn't There An App For That?","LastPostDate":1442400675},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
