20\" Satin Napkins \u00e2\u20ac\u201c TiffanyBlue\/Aqua - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 25.00 (QTY 4 - 10 PCS PKS Plus extras from an opened pkg)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">12\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx116\u00e2\u20ac\u009d Organza Sash \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Ivory - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 50.00 (QTY 50)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Wedding Tropics Linen Attire Samples<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 10.00<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*Embroidery Thread Color Sample Booklet<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*Shirts, Pants & Dresses Samples (White, Ivory, Ecru)<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*Pants Sample -- Khaki<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">3x3x3 Turquoise Favor Box-100pc - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 20.00 (QTY 76 boxes)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Favors - Yankee Candle Votive Holders - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 25.00 (5 bxs of 3 - 15 votive holders)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">ID Badge Holder \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Resealable, Vertical Orientation, 2.625 x 3.75 Inches, Pre-Punched, NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 10.00 (Qty 25)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">8 Blank Cotton Bags \u00e2\u20ac\u201c NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:rgb(44,44,44)\"><span  