{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79362a5a478a3775417c77eeb235ce87","RawContent":"I think I will use the TA&#039;s here. Thanks ebredhawk!","Attachments":[],"Id":805823,"PostDate":1250622921,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think I will use the TA's here. Thanks ebredhawk!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jak.05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.65.198.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1240940711,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217125.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"xxashleyxx007","Id":217125,"Name":"xxashleyxx007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d3bae6f2200f9859e254d41e1aca4d8","RawContent":"I was hoping to pay $4000 for my fiance and I to go to Dreams PC for two weeks taxes\/insurance in and $1500 taxes\/insurance in MAX for my guests. Is this reasonable for dreams? I found these prices on expedia for this year at the time that I would like to go next year. I know there are issues with expedia and would prefer to use a TA, but honestly, I talked to a TA who said that those prices are impossible to get for Dreams PC (but I saw them on expedia!). The prices she is telling me I will likely pay are WAY higher ($1500 before taxes\/insurance for one week) and, quite frankly, would be a deal breaker and my guests would likely not go. I am in Toronto, Canada. Any thoughts?","Attachments":[],"Id":806349,"PostDate":1250644721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was hoping to pay $4000 for my fiance and I to go to Dreams PC for two weeks taxes\/insurance in and $1500 taxes\/insurance in MAX for my guests. Is this reasonable for dreams? I found these prices on expedia for this year at the time that I would like to go next year. I know there are issues with expedia and would prefer to use a TA, but honestly, I talked to a TA who said that those prices are impossible to get for Dreams PC (but I saw them on expedia!). The prices she is telling me I will likely pay are WAY higher ($1500 before taxes\/insurance for one week) and, quite frankly, would be a deal breaker and my guests would likely not go. I am in Toronto, Canada. Any thoughts?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nolanss@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245773460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218714.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SSNM","Id":218714,"Name":"SSNM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50625ea6a5ddc8cbf86ce33909fa729c","RawContent":"I have been getting quotes for approx. $1250-1350+ taxes $309+ for the third week in January, we should be having about 40 people going. Many of the tour companies like selloffvacations or itravel2000.com just give discounts for 10+ people booking, which is kinda weird as you would think the more going the bigger the discount.","Attachments":[],"Id":806434,"PostDate":1250648831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have been getting quotes for approx. $1250-1350+ taxes $309+ for the third week in January, we should be having about 40 people going. Many of the tour companies like selloffvacations or itravel2000.com just give discounts for 10+ people booking, which is kinda weird as you would think the more going the bigger the discount.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20100120\/e\/on+my+way+to+being+mrs+L\/k\/e51f\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e51f\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tamtret@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1249049949,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220034.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tam","Id":220034,"Name":"Tam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"552d5483ef9bacc4985aa837bea57662","RawContent":"SSNM, \n Try selloffvacations or itravel2000. Or, when you talk to any TA, make sure you tell them you would like internet pricing or close to it. Flight centre.ca is not bad and they will price match from anyone if it&#039;s on the same day. I am currently trying to price for DPC too and am also from T.O. \n Right now as well, selloff is having a special that I think ends tomorrow, but the tax is only about $200 and the trip is $1238\/person. This also includes for every 11 adults booked, the 12 is free. \n Awesome deal from everything I&#039;ve seen, but they require payment in full by Aug.25.\n So, I am going to ask again for prices Aug. 26 and hope for at least a month....no idea why the hotel has it set up that way...and not much time to give to your guests to pay either. \n Don&#039;t forget too that you can negotiate price a bit .... just think that even the internet companies are still TAs do not earn their money, but I just look at it like I have already done a lot of the leg work ...finding the hotel, contacting the WC to find out dates, etc.\n Sorry for the long message, but hope this helps.\n Also, let me know if you find a good TA or price. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":806466,"PostDate":1250649583,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                SSNM, <br \/> Try selloffvacations or itravel2000. Or, when you talk to any TA, make sure you tell them you would like internet pricing or close to it. Flight centre.ca is not bad and they will price match from anyone if it's on the same day. I am currently trying to price for DPC too and am also from T.O. <br \/> Right now as well, selloff is having a special that I think ends tomorrow, but the tax is only about $200 and the trip is $1238\/person. This also includes for every 11 adults booked, the 12 is free. <br \/> Awesome deal from everything I've seen, but they require payment in full by Aug.25.<br \/> So, I am going to ask again for prices Aug. 26 and hope for at least a month....no idea why the hotel has it set up that way...and not much time to give to your guests to pay either. <br \/> Don't forget too that you can negotiate price a bit .... just think that even the internet companies are still TAs do not earn their money, but I just look at it like I have already done a lot of the leg work ...finding the hotel, contacting the WC to find out dates, etc.<br \/> Sorry for the long message, but hope this helps.<br \/> Also, let me know if you find a good TA or price. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20100120\/e\/on+my+way+to+being+mrs+L\/k\/e51f\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e51f\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tamtret@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1249049949,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220034.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tam","Id":220034,"Name":"Tam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b521a1bea73fc4fd6e165ec44c2c4345","RawContent":"Ditto about letting me know if you find a good TA, I&#039;m in Red Deer, Alberta but we will be flying out of T.O.! =)","Attachments":[],"Id":806508,"PostDate":1250650668,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ditto about letting me know if you find a good TA, I'm in Red Deer, Alberta but we will be flying out of T.O.! =)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jak.05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.65.198.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1240940711,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217125.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"xxashleyxx007","Id":217125,"Name":"xxashleyxx007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5fae5249e8a6cad12a2b0af6d2cb323","RawContent":"SSNM, I forgot to mention for you to check sunwing.ca too. I just went on all the websites I mentioned and the prices were $1255 + tax.","Attachments":[],"Id":806526,"PostDate":1250651075,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                SSNM, I forgot to mention for you to check sunwing.ca too. I just went on all the websites I mentioned and the prices were $1255 + tax.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20100120\/e\/on+my+way+to+being+mrs+L\/k\/e51f\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e51f\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tamtret@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1249049949,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220034.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tam","Id":220034,"Name":"Tam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13d825f9203ddd14751dcf12b925772a","RawContent":"Thanks Tam. I heard sunwing has some good rates right now, but I also heard they are a bit unstable and might go the way of conquest and jetsgo...I have since done some research on the difference between TA&#039;s and online booking and it really does seem like you just have to wait for a good tide to come in and then ride it when it comes to prices for trips no matter who\/what you book with. Ofcourse you have to take in to consideration various things like if the price includes transfers, taxes\/fees for entering the country (10$ USD for D.R., right??), layovers, etc. I would like to use a DW-TA just to have an advocate in the even something goes wrong, to negotiate better wedding packages, and to let me know of important things about travelling that I may not think about...if the price is too much though, I might have to fall back on extensive research and good insurance!\n \n Anyway, I digress from the topic at hand. Perhaps people would like to share what they paid to stay at Dreams PC or perhaps have other questions on Dreams PC? Actually, I have one:\n \n Children meals? How much? I was told 1\/2 price of an adult by the WC but I have heard of people paying $5\/kid (much less than 1\/2 price)! My feeling is that it is 1\/2 price when the kids are eating rack of lamb with the rest of the adults but $5 if they are eating chicken fingers...but my WC made it sound like it was 1\/2 price for chicken fingers??","Attachments":[],"Id":806536,"PostDate":1250651484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Tam. I heard sunwing has some good rates right now, but I also heard they are a bit unstable and might go the way of conquest and jetsgo...I have since done some research on the difference between TA's and online booking and it really does seem like you just have to wait for a good tide to come in and then ride it when it comes to prices for trips no matter who\/what you book with. Ofcourse you have to take in to consideration various things like if the price includes transfers, taxes\/fees for entering the country (10$ USD for D.R., right??), layovers, etc. I would like to use a DW-TA just to have an advocate in the even something goes wrong, to negotiate better wedding packages, and to let me know of important things about travelling that I may not think about...if the price is too much though, I might have to fall back on extensive research and good insurance!<br \/> <br \/> Anyway, I digress from the topic at hand. Perhaps people would like to share what they paid to stay at Dreams PC or perhaps have other questions on Dreams PC? Actually, I have one:<br \/> <br \/> Children meals? How much? I was told 1\/2 price of an adult by the WC but I have heard of people paying $5\/kid (much less than 1\/2 price)! My feeling is that it is 1\/2 price when the kids are eating rack of lamb with the rest of the adults but $5 if they are eating chicken fingers...but my WC made it sound like it was 1\/2 price for chicken fingers??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nolanss@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245773460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218714.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SSNM","Id":218714,"Name":"SSNM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"966c792f7767e47f9cbc8dde57581cf7","RawContent":"Hi ladies!\n \n Personal experience right now is that any prices you are being quoted right now (and those for online) for later in 2010 are &amp;quot;early booking bonus&amp;quot; quotes. My FH and I are getting married July 1st or 2nd next year and the prices we are getting would require that everyone in our party be all paid up by November 30th! Not even we can afford to do that (we have a wedding to pay for after all!)\n So when you are speaking to your TA&#039;s just verify that with the prices you&#039;re being quoted that your guests have until 60 days (or whatever the minimum may be with that company) to pay for their trip.\n \n :)","Attachments":[],"Id":806762,"PostDate":1250680867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies!<br \/> <br \/> Personal experience right now is that any prices you are being quoted right now (and those for online) for later in 2010 are \"early booking bonus\" quotes. My FH and I are getting married July 1st or 2nd next year and the prices we are getting would require that everyone in our party be all paid up by November 30th! Not even we can afford to do that (we have a wedding to pay for after all!)<br \/> So when you are speaking to your TA's just verify that with the prices you're being quoted that your guests have until 60 days (or whatever the minimum may be with that company) to pay for their trip.<br \/> <br \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>Enjoying marital bliss since July 1st, 2010<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nat_5636@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1249244846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220085.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nsbride2010","Id":220085,"Name":"nsbride2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce30658b27e85b6d25ae24c13c48da3a","RawContent":"by the way Ashley 007 I can send you the bouquet choices if you&#039;d like, I got them from Deyanira last week! Just post your email :)","Attachments":[],"Id":806763,"PostDate":1250680939,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                by the way Ashley 007 I can send you the bouquet choices if you'd like, I got them from Deyanira last week! Just post your email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>Enjoying marital bliss since July 1st, 2010<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nat_5636@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1249244846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220085.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nsbride2010","Id":220085,"Name":"nsbride2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3f89a44d1e16c9fb9324fd2e71aa4ce","RawContent":"Just thought I would let you all know that I have had to cancel our DW. We are disappointed but I think it is for the best. We are going to have a wedding at home instead. I wish you all the best at your weddings! good luck.","Attachments":[],"Id":806847,"PostDate":1250687597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just thought I would let you all know that I have had to cancel our DW. We are disappointed but I think it is for the best. We are going to have a wedding at home instead. I wish you all the best at your weddings! good luck.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20100428\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/2\/k\/6dd4\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...6dd4\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nancy_dinn@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1244930231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218420.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ndinn","Id":218420,"Name":"ndinn","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4754,"TotalPages":476,"CurrentPage":310,"NextPage":320,"PreviousPage":300,"LastPage":4750},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
