078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies!<br \/> <br \/> Anyone that asked for the bouquet options should have them now, I sent them from my email of <a href='mailto:natashanaugle@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>natashanaugle@hotmail.com<\/a> (in case it ends up in junk somehow!)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>Enjoying marital bliss since July 1st, 2010<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nat_5636@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1249244846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220085.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nsbride2010","Id":220085,"Name":"nsbride2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b66690a53512132bc93d1a7544c51d25","RawContent":"When I got married there (July 1\/09) there is a huge binder that I got to choose from. Anywhere from regular roses to tropical bouquets. Mine was pink roses with pink lillies, it looked beautiful. My pics are posted somewhere on this thread!!\n \n nsbride - Im from Nova Scotia too!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":804568,"PostDate":1250544311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                When I got married there (July 1\/09) there is a huge binder that I got to choose from. Anywhere from regular roses to tropical bouquets. Mine was pink roses with pink lillies, it looked beautiful. My pics are posted somewhere on this thread!!<br \/> <br \/> nsbride - Im from Nova Scotia too!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;405\/st\/20090701\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Punta+Cana\/k\/749d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...749d\/event.png<\/a><br><br><strong>37 PEOPLE BOOKED!!!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kylie_felix@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231470021,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/3\/3f\/3f6cc7d2_wedding?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DreamsBride09","Id":213749,"Name":"DreamsBride09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c7cedee600b253428c98e32df7e16ec","RawContent":"im considering a travel agent. what have urs offered for u @ dreams? can any of u recommend one to me?","Attachments":[],"Id":805501,"PostDate":1250609953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                im considering a travel agent. what have urs offered for u @ dreams? can any of u recommend one to me?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/9Nwym8.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/9Nwym8.png<\/a><br><br><span>xo, Jennifer<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jennifercogswell09@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1249920389,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220381.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cogswellgray","Id":220381,"Name":"cogswellgray","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b35c01d198f4409cffa82cf7e6c5d638","RawContent":"Another price\/TA related question for you ladies... \n \n Did you do a group booking? How many people? What was the price per person for that amount of people? I just want to get a ball park figure if you don&#039;t mind. \n \n Also, flower related: Did you happen to see any bouquets that were purple or aqua?? \n \n Thanks in advance!","Attachments":[],"Id":805516,"PostDate":1250610314,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Another price\/TA related question for you ladies... <br \/> <br \/> Did you do a group booking? How many people? What was the price per person for that amount of people? I just want to get a ball park figure if you don't mind. <br \/> <br \/> Also, flower related: Did you happen to see any bouquets that were purple or aqua?? <br \/> <br \/> Thanks in advance!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jak.05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.65.198.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1240940711,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217125.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"xxashleyxx007","Id":217125,"Name":"xxashleyxx007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b216341de41382a2da7d8a0ec31fb558","RawContent":"i think price and how your booking is made is completely based on where you are coming from. for my guests, it was cheaper to book air and hotel at once since there is a charter airline (USA 3000) that goes from cincinnati to punta cana directly as opposed to using a group rate at the hotel and booking separately. there are some tour operators that do group discounts though... have you thought of using one of the TAs on this site? they each have specialties and i have heard nothing but good things about them!","Attachments":[],"Id":805722,"PostDate":1250617999,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i think price and how your booking is made is completely based on where you are coming from. for my guests, it was cheaper to book air and hotel at once since there is a charter airline (USA 3000) that goes from cincinnati to punta cana directly as opposed to using a group rate at the hotel and booking separately. there are some tour operators that do group discounts though... have you thought of using one of the TAs on this site? they each have specialties and i have heard nothing but good things about them!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i721.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww211\/ebredhawk\/ejttd_0008.jpg\">http:\/\/i721.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...ejttd_0008.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/blog.eyespy-weddings.com\/\">eyespy photography<\/a><br><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/dreams-punta-cana-la-barcaza-review-4-28-10-super-long-58714\">my Dreams Punta Cana\/La Barcaza review<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ebredhawk@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1234819618,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214967.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ebredhawk","Id":214967,"Name":"ebredhawk","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4754,"TotalPages":476,"CurrentPage":300,"NextPage":310,"PreviousPage":290,"LastPage":4750},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
