{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c68487142aa4c18153df57a98fcc36d","RawContent":"I ladies!! I apologize if this was already frought up in this thread! This is my post here!\n \n We are not planning our DW until Feb 2011, os we do have some time on our side.\n \n We were originally thinking Barcelo Bavaro Palace Deluxe, as they have they stay at one play at 5 option, which would be nice for quests who are more price concious. \n \n However I was wanting to use Photo Souviner, and asked the WC at Barcelo, and she stated no outside photograpghers are allowed, you have to use theirs, Tropical Pictures, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.tropicalpictures.com.dom\"&gt;www.tropicalpictures.com.dom&lt;\/a&gt;, and I don&#039;t care for their website, or package options.\n \n Does Dreams have a restriction on outside photograpghers? What are you ladies doing?\n \n I am now considering other resorts!","Attachments":[],"Id":798570,"PostDate":1250127310,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I ladies!! I apologize if this was already frought up in this thread! This is my post here!<br \/> <br \/> We are not planning our DW until Feb 2011, os we do have some time on our side.<br \/> <br \/> We were originally thinking Barcelo Bavaro Palace Deluxe, as they have they stay at one play at 5 option, which would be nice for quests who are more price concious. <br \/> <br \/> However I was wanting to use Photo Souviner, and asked the WC at Barcelo, and she stated no outside photograpghers are allowed, you have to use theirs, Tropical Pictures, <a href='http:\/\/www.tropicalpictures.com.dom' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.tropicalpictures.com.dom<\/a>, and I don't care for their website, or package options.<br \/> <br \/> Does Dreams have a restriction on outside photograpghers? What are you ladies doing?<br \/> <br \/> I am now considering other resorts!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennt4@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1246244213,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218890.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenn&Kraig","Id":218890,"Name":"Jenn&Kraig","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ce2871b41a21bcc5f2b9163becc433c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jenn&amp;amp;Kraig&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Does Dreams have a restriction on outside photograpghers? What are you ladies doing?\n \n I am now considering other resorts!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I believe Dreams allows outside photographers as long as the day pass fee is paid for them to come onto the resort. I was going to go with the resort photographer but I am now looking into photosouvenir as they seem to get rave reviews and I have particular needs with my wedding package.","Attachments":[],"Id":798838,"PostDate":1250143781,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jenn&Kraig<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Does Dreams have a restriction on outside photograpghers? What are you ladies doing?<br \/> <br \/> I am now considering other resorts!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I believe Dreams allows outside photographers as long as the day pass fee is paid for them to come onto the resort. I was going to go with the resort photographer but I am now looking into photosouvenir as they seem to get rave reviews and I have particular needs with my wedding package.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nolanss@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245773460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218714.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SSNM","Id":218714,"Name":"SSNM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fb8fab58f6e9117157328dd169bc602","RawContent":"my email address is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:nat_5636@hotmail.com\"&gt;nat_5636@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Thanks so much!!","Attachments":[],"Id":798882,"PostDate":1250164197,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                my email address is <a href='mailto:nat_5636@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>nat_5636@hotmail.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Thanks so much!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>Enjoying marital bliss since July 1st, 2010<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nat_5636@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1249244846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220085.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nsbride2010","Id":220085,"Name":"nsbride2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13a8843cff763d0e8b77ee7ce175d3fc","RawContent":"Hi everyone,\n \n I too am planning to be married at Dreams punta cana. I just got engaged in June and thus we have not started anything yet. We are planning a trip to DR in October this year to have a look however Dreams is our top choice based on the website, travel advisors and word of mouth from friends.\n \n Congrats and good luck planning to everyone!","Attachments":[],"Id":799157,"PostDate":1250176376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone,<br \/> <br \/> I too am planning to be married at Dreams punta cana. I just got engaged in June and thus we have not started anything yet. We are planning a trip to DR in October this year to have a look however Dreams is our top choice based on the website, travel advisors and word of mouth from friends.<br \/> <br \/> Congrats and good luck planning to everyone!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"akkelly@connect.carleton.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1250016003,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220427.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akkelly","Id":220427,"Name":"akkelly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c8d37c06e6a90fb428b135dd5c57831","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jenn&amp;amp;Kraig&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I ladies!! I apologize if this was already frought up in this thread! This is my post here!\n \n We are not planning our DW until Feb 2011, os we do have some time on our side.\n \n We were originally thinking Barcelo Bavaro Palace Deluxe, as they have they stay at one play at 5 option, which would be nice for quests who are more price concious. \n \n However I was wanting to use Photo Souviner, and asked the WC at Barcelo, and she stated no outside photograpghers are allowed, you have to use theirs, Tropical Pictures, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.tropicalpictures.com.dom\"&gt;www.tropicalpictures.com.dom&lt;\/a&gt;, and I don&#039;t care for their website, or package options.\n \n Does Dreams have a restriction on outside photograpghers? What are you ladies doing?\n \n I am now considering other resorts!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n You CAN use outside photographers. The resort fee for the day is $79 USD. We used HDC photo if you&#039;re still looking for someone. Their package was a great deal and the photographer was super nice and easy to work with! Plus, we had all of our prints and CD copy in 4 days!! We&#039;re still waiting for the photo-book and website, but Arnaud (who runs it) responds very quickly to any inquiries you may have!","Attachments":[],"Id":799795,"PostDate":1250200691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jenn&Kraig<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I ladies!! I apologize if this was already frought up in this thread! This is my post here!<br \/> <br \/> We are not planning our DW until Feb 2011, os we do have some time on our side.<br \/> <br \/> We were originally thinking Barcelo Bavaro Palace Deluxe, as they have they stay at one play at 5 option, which would be nice for quests who are more price concious. <br \/> <br \/> However I was wanting to use Photo Souviner, and asked the WC at Barcelo, and she stated no outside photograpghers are allowed, you have to use theirs, Tropical Pictures, <a href='http:\/\/www.tropicalpictures.com.dom' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.tropicalpictures.com.dom<\/a>, and I don't care for their website, or package options.<br \/> <br \/> Does Dreams have a restriction on outside photograpghers? What are you ladies doing?<br \/> <br \/> I am now considering other resorts!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> You CAN use outside photographers. The resort fee for the day is $79 USD. We used HDC photo if you're still looking for someone. Their package was a great deal and the photographer was super nice and easy to work with! Plus, we had all of our prints and CD copy in 4 days!! We're still waiting for the photo-book and website, but Arnaud (who runs it) responds very quickly to any inquiries you may have!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/davf.daisypath.com\/KqcTm7.png\">http:\/\/davf.daisypath.com\/KqcTm7.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lei_la007@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231739658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213870.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lp579","Id":213870,"Name":"lp579","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c207915d4f43037315abc6149f65dbe6","RawContent":"I am also getting married at Dreams Punta Cana March 2010. My wedding coordinator is Sharon who is so far WONDERFUL. She responds to all my emails within minutes, or the most in two days. She&#039;s great.","Attachments":[],"Id":799996,"PostDate":1250208016,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am also getting married at Dreams Punta Cana March 2010. My wedding coordinator is Sharon who is so far WONDERFUL. She responds to all my emails within minutes, or the most in two days. She's great.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brendalee8@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1235002812,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215049.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BLJM","Id":215049,"Name":"BLJM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"886b3b9e22395794f77615ea5c484e44","RawContent":"Dreams does allow outside photographers, my photographer happens to be staying for the whole time so, he won&#039;t have to pay for that day pass. My WC is Sharron and Deyanira and they are great at responding although neither one of them have answered my questions about the bouquet options yet lol..... \n \n nsbride I&#039;ll email the packages first thing in the am I have them all saved on my work computer. \n \n congrats Akkelly !","Attachments":[],"Id":800009,"PostDate":1250208589,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Dreams does allow outside photographers, my photographer happens to be staying for the whole time so, he won't have to pay for that day pass. My WC is Sharron and Deyanira and they are great at responding although neither one of them have answered my questions about the bouquet options yet lol..... <br \/> <br \/> nsbride I'll email the packages first thing in the am I have them all saved on my work computer. <br \/> <br \/> congrats Akkelly !\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married June 18, 2010 @ Dreams Punta Cana<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"gixxergirl04@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1248723981,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219884.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":71,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lrdavis23","Id":219884,"Name":"lrdavis23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"264f321b1bddc2dd140435bbb0f68668","RawContent":"lrdavis - Deyanira emailed me the bouquet choices, so give me your email and I will send them along! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":800546,"PostDate":1250248982,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\