    body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                time to bump this for sure <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alyssa.brantley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1182313860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207483.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Alyssa","Id":207483,"Name":"Alyssa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afd3799a107858365a32505a4b9fdfe6","RawContent":"Hi Administrators\/Moderators,\n \n Yesterday I logged on and could not see the website. It told me I was banned for &amp;quot;spamming destine2design&amp;quot; posts. Thing is, I have no idea what destine2design is!! I sent an e-mail via the Contact Us link and have not heard back.\n \n When I logged on today it allowed me to see the forum but the banner was still showing as &amp;quot;Banned&amp;quot; under my name when I checked some of my posts.\n \n I just posted this here and noticed it now shows Noob and the Banned banner is gone. Can someone please explain what happened? Did you guys accidentally ban me then take it off? \n \n I just want to avoid this happening again...it&#039;s no fun seeing that message when you log in. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/frown.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1034548,"PostDate":1266189657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Administrators\/Moderators,<br \/> <br \/> Yesterday I logged on and could not see the website. It told me I was banned for \"spamming destine2design\" posts. Thing is, I have no idea what destine2design is!! I sent an e-mail via the Contact Us link and have not heard back.<br \/> <br \/> When I logged on today it allowed me to see the forum but the banner was still showing as \"Banned\" under my name when I checked some of my posts.<br \/> <br \/> I just posted this here and noticed it now shows Noob and the Banned banner is gone. Can someone please explain what happened? Did you guys accidentally ban me then take it off? <br \/> <br \/> I just want to avoid this happening again...it's no fun seeing that message when you log in. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/frown.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/w7NSnHf\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...nHf\/weight.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20110510\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/fd0b\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...fd0b\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><strong>27 booked...and counting!!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"fanfia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"167.92.67.10","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1262820146,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224382.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":92,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bikegirl","Id":224382,"Name":"bikegirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffe3eff45892dfa02d07c24f7e281833","RawContent":"hi bikergirl, you did actually accidentaly get banned...a mod mistakenly banned your account instead of a member that was spamming...that member has been banned and your ban, obviously lifted.","Attachments":[],"Id":1034587,"PostDate":1266191901,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                hi bikergirl, you did actually accidentaly get banned...a mod mistakenly banned your account instead of a member that was spamming...that member has been banned and your ban, obviously lifted.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.