":false,"PostKey":"421b5c85bd02380520f669ac9367b67a","RawContent":"When people are banned, are they permanently banned, or temporarily banned? I was just wondering because someone that was very helpful to me is now banned. Can we still pm her? I&#039;m sorry I&#039;m asking all of this, but I did a search and all I could find on bans was what you could do to get banned. I&#039;m always afraid that I am going to do something on accident to get banned. This site is amazing and I seriously think it was a gift from above (or TammyHost... lol) and would hate to be blocked from its addictive qualities.","Attachments":[],"Id":1054735,"PostDate":1267397311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                When people are banned, are they permanently banned, or temporarily banned? I was just wondering because someone that was very helpful to me is now banned. Can we still pm her? I'm sorry I'm asking all of this, but I did a search and all I could find on bans was what you could do to get banned. I'm always afraid that I am going to do something on accident to get banned. This site is amazing and I seriously think it was a gift from above (or TammyHost... lol) and would hate to be blocked from its addictive qualities.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"peterpanpixiedust@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1264860437,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225169.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":