\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>AnnR<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Nic, I haven't received my flowers, gift certificate, or chocolates yet. I've been waiting by the door!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>heeeeheeee <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/popcorn.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Popcorn\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> meee tooo\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbie.chalcraft@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.147.88.43","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1194490440,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207912.jpg?_r=1386394469","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Abbie","Id":207912,"Name":"Abbie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"319961296c5e24e2493d71e4080df55b","RawContent":"Nic I didn&#039;t get anything today, and since there is no mail tomorrow I will wait again Friday!\n Thanks for being so thoughtful!\n \n hahahaha","Attachments":[],"Id":520858,"PostDate":1227774748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Nic I didn't get anything today, and since there is no mail tomorrow I will wait again Friday!<br \/> Thanks for being so thoughtful!<br \/> <br \/> hahahaha\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165989180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf02046f1156e47da2106596ab36f396","RawContent":"i have a question- when a member is banned, what exactly is banned? is it their email? username? ip address? i know that this is a public forum and if you google you can read posts from here but does that change once you&#039;re banned?\n \n i don&#039;t plan on getting banned anytime soon, i&#039;m just curious &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/fryingpan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Fryingpan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":523825,"PostDate":1228204480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i have a question- when a member is banned, what exactly is banned? is it their email? username? ip address? i know that this is a public forum and if you google you can read posts from here but does that change once you're banned?<br \/> <br \/> i don't plan on getting banned anytime soon, i'm just curious <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/fryingpan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Fryingpan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"knaioti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.221.76.92","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188935880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207699.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":83,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katrina","Id":207699,"Name":"katrina","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab09457d704eb389249b5cc2886799ff","RawContent":"Katrina - I beleive there are flags on all 3 of the things mentioned. When someone is banned, I think it&#039;s their username\/email address that is immediately banned. Banning their IP is an additional separate step, but I am like 99% sure that they can no longer view the site either from that IP address once it is banned.\n \n Tammy or other mods, please correct anything I said that may not be correct.","Attachments":[],"Id":524097,"PostDate":1228249963,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Katrina - I beleive there are flags on all 3 of the things mentioned. When someone is banned, I think it's their username\/email address that is immediately banned. Banning their IP is an additional separate step, but I am like 99% sure that they can no longer view the site either from that IP address once it is banned.<br \/> <br \/> Tammy or other mods, please correct anything I said that may not be correct.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177552500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28537b4486d399db6e351a61a9c7fe3e","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.planetsmilies.com\/smilies\/sign\/sign0178.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":655833,"PostDate":1239846376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.planetsmilies.com\/smilies\/sign\/sign0178.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168274640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73088ff99f3d5615975148dc9f33bb77","RawContent":"Bumping......","Attachments":[],"Id":685395,"PostDate":1241902938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Bumping......\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177552500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":65,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
