Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ead1a8374221cc103d88cbe2bc0c00f1","RawContent":"&amp;quot;~~ If you choose to badger the administration about the rules and what you think they should be, you may be banned.&amp;quot;\n \n This always, always bugged me. I used to run a music forum awhile back that was pretty popular and sucked up a lot of my money. Nothing bugged me more than when people complained about my &amp;quot;rules.&amp;quot; Bottom line is... Tammy is the one who pays for this upkeep of this forum and she can have whatever rules she wants. From experience I know it&#039;s a lot of $$$, if you hate the rules and want to change things the solution is simple, put your money where your mouth is, open your own forum and make your own rules.\n \n Not trying to give you any competition Tammy, but I just think people don&#039;t fully realize how much of a drain (even though it can be fun in a way) running a message board can be sometimes and the amount of money it takes to keep it running, especially one that gets this much traffic.","Attachments":[],"Id":520083,"PostDate":1227733610,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \"~~ If you choose to badger the administration about the rules and what you think they should be, you may be banned.\"<br \/> <br \/> This always, always bugged me. I used to run a music forum awhile back that was pretty popular and sucked up a lot of my money. Nothing bugged me more than when people complained about my \"rules.\" Bottom line is... Tammy is the one who pays for this upkeep of this forum and she can have whatever rules she wants. From experience I know it's a lot of $$$, if you hate the rules and want to change things the solution is simple, put your money where your mouth is, open your own forum and make your own rules.<br \/> <br \/> Not trying to give you any competition Tammy, but I just think people don't fully realize how much of a drain (even though it can be fun in a way) running a message board can be sometimes and the amount of money it takes to keep it running, especially one that gets this much traffic.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ocasiojessica@aol.com","IpAddress":"72.82.169.76","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1174606020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessica","Id":207276,"Name":"Jessica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68364fc3d02954d01d6e184f96a93d1c","RawContent":"i also have to re-iterate that you may not like the rules or think they are fair BUT if you chose to not follow them, DO NOT be surprised if you are banned.\n \n I don&#039;t care why you didn&#039;t follow them. We have a bunch of great vendors tht do follow the rules and it is not fair to them if we ignore the rule breakers.","Attachments":[],"Id":520223,"PostDate":1227738900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i also have to re-iterate that you may not like the rules or think they are fair BUT if you chose to not follow them, DO NOT be surprised if you are banned.<br \/> <br \/> I don't care why you didn't follow them. We have a bunch of great vendors tht do follow the rules and it is not fair to them if we ignore the rule breakers.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86596b2d2a47b7d647cad4c34b236324","RawContent":"Thank yall for keeping us in the loop and always watching out for us... It&#039;s greatly appreciated from my end!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":520226,"PostDate":1227739093,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank yall for keeping us in the loop and always watching out for us... It's greatly appreciated from my end!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i57.photobucket.com\/albums\/g209\/kacie3344\/Wedding%20Pro%20Teasers\/firstkissasmarried-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i57.photobucket.com\/albums\/g2...smarried-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/3dzh1ilhlaiz.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/3dzh1ilhlaiz.png<\/a><br><br><br><strong>OUR SLIDESHOW!<\/strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.josephmark.com\/StuartandCasey\/\">http:\/\/www.josephmark.com\/StuartandCasey\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"caseysatullo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1213217700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209890.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Casey*","Id":209890,"Name":"*Casey*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5eef73c9c2b2b7383afba2d7dff0138b","RawContent":"Thank you ladies, firstly for all your hard work and secondly, for ensuring that we are always up to speed.\n Perhaps, when the decision is made to ban a specific vendor or member we could post this somewhere. Personally, I went insane trying to find a thread from a specific vendor...who turns out was recently banned (LisaMarkPhotography). Just a thought...\n Thank you again ladies! I cannot express my gratitude to the forum enough (especially being a DT bride) I full endorse a &amp;quot;MOD APPRECIATION DAY&amp;quot;","Attachments":[],"Id":520260,"PostDate":1227740364,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you ladies, firstly for all your hard work and secondly, for ensuring that we are always up to speed.<br \/> Perhaps, when the decision is made to ban a specific vendor or member we could post this somewhere. Personally, I went insane trying to find a thread from a specific vendor...who turns out was recently banned (LisaMarkPhotography). Just a thought...<br \/> Thank you again ladies! I cannot express my gratitude to the forum enough (especially being a DT bride) I full endorse a \"MOD APPRECIATION DAY\"\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/kh9acqgcp.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/kh9acqgcp.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rachelannmartin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1210717541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209380.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelannmartin","Id":209380,"Name":"rachelannmartin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b5ed33d4c2c5efde3220aefdf01484f","RawContent":"Mod Day is a great idea Nic.","Attachments":[],"Id":520266,"PostDate":1227740586,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mod Day is a great idea Nic.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>***Married November 6, 2008***Gavin Born February 28th, 2010***<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/32855\/danielle-s-paradisus-palma-real-wedding-review-long\">Paradisus Palma Real Wedding Review<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www2.snapfish.com\/snapfish\/thumbnailshare\/AlbumID=260961377\/a=55019552_55019552\/otsc=SHR\/otsi=SALBlink\/COBRAND_NAME=snapfish\/\">Our Professional Wedding Pictures on Snapfish<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dnllmz@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.168.140.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1194561900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207914.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DanielleNDerek","Id":207914,"Name":"DanielleNDerek","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e151b1fdb2eafa7a17f28f5dd7a7409","RawContent":"Just an FYI, when a member gets banned, their posts remain on the forum unless there is some negative content. So you should usually be able to find any threads started by that vendor\/member. However, I know that a few threads specifically were removed due to the drama that was contained in them. So normally a search can still be performed for threads even after someone is banned.\n \n Also, the reasons for banning, or the fact that someone is banned at all, isn&#039;t public information. The only exception is sometimes when a vendor is banned.","Attachments":[],"Id":520270,"PostDate":1227740716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just an FYI, when a member gets banned, their posts remain on the forum unless there is some negative content. So you should usually be able to find any threads started by that vendor\/member. However, I know that a few threads specifically were removed due to the drama that was contained in them. So normally a search can still be performed for threads even after someone is banned.<br \/> <br \/> Also, the reasons for banning, or the fact that someone is banned at all, isn't public information. The only exception is sometimes when a vendor is banned.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177552500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e17ed8b99708768b184295602b3b8e3","RawContent":"AAAAH! That makes total sense...thanks Carly! I seriously had moments when I felt like I was going crazy HAHAHA\n Sanity has returned!","Attachments":[],"Id":520272,"PostDate":1227740945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                AAAAH! That makes total sense...thanks Carly! I seriously had moments when I felt like I was going crazy HAHAHA<br \/> Sanity has returned!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/kh9acqgcp.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/kh9acqgcp.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rachelannmartin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1210717541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209380.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelannmartin","Id":209380,"Name":"rachelannmartin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4620cb0dc3e584ec1b6952997a82716","RawContent":"I would also like to mention that when Tammy &amp;amp; the mods feel you deserve to know about a banning, we post. When it is really none of anyone&#8217;s business why a person gets banned, we don&#8217;t post any explanation, and we typically won&#8217;t answer questions about it either. But rest assured that every member (bride or vendor) who gets banned &#8211; there is a chain of evidence, so to speak, of their bad behavior leading up to the ban. Nobody ever gets banned &#8220;just because.&#8221; We don&#8217;t want any of you ladies thinking you will get banned for voicing any opinion, but often when it comes to banning, we just don&#8217;t air the dirty laundry. I know that sometimes that looks one sided, however, it&#8217;s in the best interest of the forum to not create any drama where it&#8217;s not necessary. If we don&#8217;t post why someone was recently banned, you can assume that it&#8217;s not your business to ask and it was done to keep the forum running smoothly because that person was breaking rules, harassing the admins or creating havoc in some way.\n \n On a day to day basis, we deal with lots of vendors either breaking rules or spamming. This is something you as a regular member usually never witness, and so of course you don&#8217;t know the backstory when someone gets their first warning &amp;amp; what they did\/said after the warning that may have gotten them banned.\n \n Of course, I want to also address the fact that some of you keep in contact with banned vendors or members after they are no longer welcome here &#8211; let me just say that those who are banned know exactly why, and when they tell you that they were banned for &#8220;no reason&#8221; or that they &#8220;never got a warning,&#8221; that is an outright lie. Some of those people choose to write facebook notes or make facebook groups and things like that to &#8220;let everyone know why they were banned.&#8221; I have to tell you, I&#8217;ve read several of the notes that banned members have written both in the past and recently, and they completely twist the facts so people feel sorry for them. Don&#8217;t feel sorry for them. They knowingly &amp;amp; willingly broke forum rules which led to their priveleges being revoked. We run a tight ship with vendors so that you DON&#8217;T get spammed, solicited, etc. etc. We do this for YOU &#8211; to make this a safe &amp;amp; productive place for all members. When there are people who disrupt the community by breaking rules, plain &amp;amp; simple, they will be removed. \n \n Also as Tammy stated above, please remember the following:\n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt; I also wanted to add that any attitude or snarky behavior to the mods or admins will not be tolerated. \n \n this is a free forum. we volunteer our time to make the forum run smoothly and i am sure the way it is moderated is why this forum is so great. the LAST thing we need are pm&#039;s, posts from members being snarky. Especially about things they do not fully understand. &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":520294,"PostDate":1227741700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would also like to mention that when Tammy & the mods feel you deserve to know about a banning, we post. When it is really none of anyone&#8217;s business why a person gets banned, we don&#8217;t post any explanation, and we typically won&#8217;t answer questions about it either. But rest assured that every member (bride or vendor) who gets banned &#8211; there is a chain of evidence, so to speak, of their bad behavior leading up to the ban. Nobody ever gets banned &#8220;just because.&#8221; We don&#8217;t want any of you ladies thinking you will get banned for voicing any opinion, but often when it comes to banning, we just don&#8217;t air the dirty laundry. I know that sometimes that looks one sided, however, it&#8217;s in the best interest of the forum to not create any drama where it&#8217;s not necessary. If we don&#8217;t post why someone was recently banned, you can assume that it&#8217;s not your business to ask and it was done to keep the forum running smoothly because that person was breaking rules, harassing the admins or creating havoc in some way.<br \/> <br \/> On a day to day basis, we deal with lots of vendors either breaking rules or spamming. This is something you as a regular member usually never witness, and so of course you don&#8217;t know the backstory when someone gets their first warning & what they did\/said after the warning that may have gotten them banned.<br \/> <br \/> Of course, I want to also address the fact that some of you keep in contact with banned vendors or members after they are no longer welcome here &#8211; let me just say that those who are banned know exactly why, and when they tell you that they were banned for &#8220;no reason&#8221; or that they &#8220;never got a warning,&#8221; that is an outright lie. Some of those people choose to write facebook notes or make facebook groups and things like that to &#8220;let everyone know why they were banned.&#8221; I have to tell you, I&#8217;ve read several of the notes that banned members have written both in the past and recently, and they completely twist the facts so people feel sorry for them. Don&#8217;t feel sorry for them. They knowingly & willingly broke forum rules which led to their priveleges being revoked. We run a tight ship with vendors so that you DON&#8217;T get spammed, solicited, etc. etc. We do this for YOU &#8211; to make this a safe & productive place for all members. When there are people who disrupt the community by breaking rules, plain & simple, they will be removed. <br \/> <br \/> Also as Tammy stated above, please remember the following:<br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"> I also wanted to add that any attitude or snarky behavior to the mods or admins will not be tolerated. <br \/> <br \/> this is a free forum. we volunteer our time to make the forum run smoothly and i am sure the way it is moderated is why this forum is so great. the LAST thing we need are pm's, posts from members being snarky. Especially about things they do not fully understand. <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mwall.hernandez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.179.124.226","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1192217700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207843.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Maura","Id":207843,"Name":"Maura","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0a9ca95eeedfd6e54775c6dc5586779","RawContent":"Thank you all for understanding :)\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Maura&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt; I have to tell you, I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve read several of the notes that banned members have written both in the past and recently, and they completely twist the facts so people feel sorry for them. Don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t feel sorry for them. They knowingly &amp;amp; willingly broke forum rules which led to their priveleges being revoked. We run a tight ship with vendors so that you DON\u00e2\u20ac\u2122T get spammed, solicited, etc. etc. We do this for YOU \u00e2\u20ac\u201c to make this a safe &amp;amp; productive place for all members. When there are people who disrupt the community by breaking rules, plain &amp;amp; simple, they will be removed.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Good point, Maura. This happens quite often and it is inconsiderate of a banned member to put an active member in the position of having to choose sides or play one against the other. Don&#039;t fall victim to their manipulation of the facts and your feelings. They broke the rules and got banned. Period.","Attachments":[],"Id":520544,"PostDate":1227753459,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you all for understanding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Maura<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\"> I have to tell you, I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve read several of the notes that banned members have written both in the past and recently, and they completely twist the facts so people feel sorry for them. Don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t feel sorry for them. They knowingly & willingly broke forum rules which led to their priveleges being revoked. We run a tight ship with vendors so that you DON\u00e2\u20ac\u2122T get spammed, solicited, etc. etc. We do this for YOU \u00e2\u20ac\u201c to make this a safe & productive place for all members. When there are people who disrupt the community by breaking rules, plain & simple, they will be removed.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Good point, Maura. This happens quite often and it is inconsiderate of a banned member to put an active member in the position of having to choose sides or play one against the other. Don't fall victim to their manipulation of the facts and your feelings. They broke the rules and got banned. Period.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrsjamyjones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.254.135","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1168274640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":1000,"PhotoHeight":667,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"starchild","Id":207039,"Name":"starchild","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27207,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"caaa2ebcc4be201e0d80f85b804b30a9","RawContent":"Thanks girls.\n \n For me personally, this was a great tool for planning my wedding and an added perk was the building of relationships with the fellow members- which is why I still hang around. :) But seriously, I don&#039;t even understand why members get involved in all the drama- what&#039;s the point? I&#039;m sure everyone has bigger fish to fry in their normal lives. Be courteous, chat it up, plan to your heart&#039;s content and you will see no troubles.\n \n Vendors are here to build their business- first and foremost, just as we are here to plan our weddings. Don&#039;t get those roles confused. If someone messes up and got in trouble, they more than likely deserved it and broke rules. I&#039;m sorry you Mods even need to explain this. If everyone went about their business and did what they needed to do, then we wouldn&#039;t have to have PSA&#039;s to explain why people who broke rules got what was coming to &#039;em.\n \n But alas, you have to &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; so thanks for keeping our forum clean and happy. Woohoo to Mod day.","Attachments":[],"Id":520652,"PostDate":1227757333,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks girls.<br \/> <br \/> For me personally, this was a great tool for planning my wedding and an added perk was the building of relationships with the fellow members- which is why I still hang around. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> But seriously, I don't even understand why members get involved in all the drama- what's the point? I'm sure everyone has bigger fish to fry in their normal lives. Be courteous, chat it up, plan to your heart's content and you will see no troubles.<br \/> <br \/> Vendors are here to build their business- first and foremost, just as we are here to plan our weddings. Don't get those roles confused. If someone messes up and got in trouble, they more than likely deserved it and broke rules. I'm sorry you Mods even need to explain this. If everyone went about their business and did what they needed to do, then we wouldn't have to have PSA's to explain why people who broke rules got what was coming to 'em.<br \/> <br \/> But alas, you have to <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> so thanks for keeping our forum clean and happy. Woohoo to Mod day.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married since 2008<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rachie021@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.173.241.167","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1179209760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207401.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jajajaja","Id":207401,"Name":"jajajaja","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":65,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
