ality than the $3 canvas bags at Michaels\/Jo Ann Fabrics. Definitely worth the $$$! &amp;nbsp;:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1512548,"PostDate":1314632141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just a quick update for future brides.. I went ahead and ordered the cheaptotes 99 cent bags and they are AWESOME! Better quality than the $3 canvas bags at Michaels\/Jo Ann Fabrics. Definitely worth the $$$! \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jillian.young@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1286912837,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233142.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jyoung646","Id":233142,"Name":"jyoung646","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa85b858afbbfd39626007593e224b6f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve been trying to find \"good\" bags for cheap and not having much luck but I think I may have found the right ones&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_4_1_7_1324355488150_181\" src=\"http:\/\/files.be