{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"695de239a5f0b0782f9aee2242627fde","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I know the the 99 cent cheaptotes bag is really popular (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/cheaptotes.com\/canvas_tote_bag_8.html\"&gt;http:\/\/cheaptotes.com\/canvas_tote_bag_8.html&lt;\/a&gt;) but I&#039;m worried about the quality of this bag. I&#039;m willing to spend a little bit more, if necessary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We&#039;re looking for 25 natural cotton canvas bags (which we will iron-on our monogram).&amp;nbsp;Does anyone recommend another company? I didn&#039;t see anything at Oriental Trading.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Please let me know if you have any other suggestions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1506656,"PostDate":1313639548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I know the the 99 cent cheaptotes bag is really popular (<a href='http:\/\/cheaptotes.com\/canvas_tote_bag_8.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/cheaptotes.co...tote_bag_8.html<\/a>) but I'm worried about the quality of this bag. I'm willing to spend a little bit more, if necessary.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're looking for 25 natural cotton canvas bags (which we will iron-on our monogram).\u00a0Does anyone recommend another company? I didn't see anything at Oriental Trading.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Please let me know if you have any other suggestions!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jillian.young@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1286912837,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233142.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jyoung646","Id":233142,"Name":"jyoung646","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c25f9214abdcdded4071d5ec11a7924","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have heard the cheap totes canvas bags are good quality and there are a number of girls on the forum who have successfully ironed on their logos\/images.&amp;nbsp; Have you ever checked out &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingchicks.com\/shop\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingchicks.com\/shop\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; or Etsy?&amp;nbsp; You might find some of higher quality, that they can design for you?&amp;nbsp; One less project...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1506685,"PostDate":1313653628,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have heard the cheap totes canvas bags are good quality and there are a number of girls on the forum who have successfully ironed on their logos\/images.\u00a0 Have you ever checked out <a href='http:\/\/www.weddingchicks.com\/shop\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingchicks.com\/shop\/<\/a>\u00a0 or Etsy?\u00a0 You might find some of higher quality, that they can design for you?\u00a0 One less project...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><strong>Holly<\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hatfiehm@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299681224,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237611.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hatfiehm","Id":237611,"Name":"hatfiehm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2df08d12d49d8bb5308fe904cbfa2bac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are using those very same bags from cheaptotes.&amp;nbsp; I think they are decent quality and we are planning on ironing on our monogram to the bags.&amp;nbsp; I think for the price they are worth it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1507837,"PostDate":1313836215,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are using those very same bags from cheaptotes.\u00a0 I think they are decent quality and we are planning on ironing on our monogram to the bags.\u00a0 I think for the price they are worth it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jkergen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.71.240","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1293145500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JayKay","Id":234788,"Name":"JayKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75c1a8cbd30a894386d327fc0d24af65","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ok, great to know. I think I&#039;ll go ahead and order them! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1508008,"PostDate":1313861609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ok, great to know. I think I'll go ahead and order them! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jillian.young@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1286912837,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233142.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jyoung646","Id":233142,"Name":"jyoung646","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d921ee570678d52e458256ad7f7df680","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; if you have a christmas tree shop near you I got some \"beachy\" theme small totes for $1.99 each&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1508359,"PostDate":1313958178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> if you have a christmas tree shop near you I got some \"beachy\" theme small totes for $1.99 each<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ahalliday22@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295349181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235695.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2286","Id":235695,"Name":"amanda2286","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2db8c65518ec584d39865050c872a2d6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Just a quick update for future brides.. I went ahead and ordered the cheaptotes 99 cent bags and they are AWESOME! Better quality than the $3 canvas bags at Michaels\/Jo Ann Fabrics. Definitely worth the $$$! &amp;nbsp;:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1512548,"PostDate":1314632141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just a quick update for future brides.. I went ahead and ordered the cheaptotes 99 cent bags and they are AWESOME! Better quality than the $3 canvas bags at Michaels\/Jo Ann Fabrics. Definitely worth the $$$! \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jillian.young@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1286912837,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233142.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jyoung646","Id":233142,"Name":"jyoung646","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFir