alLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6db1dc0de6cb8b754b9e95e69333b9bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks ladies :) They shipped really fast too. I was surprised. About a week between order and delivery.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902087,"PostDate":1438951245,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks ladies <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> They shipped really fast too. I was surprised. About a week between order and delivery.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah_e_collier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.176.60.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435226162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283685.jpg?_r=1437401496","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"streelbride","Id":283685,"Name":"streelbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79210,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff31c40dc6f40dcc8058397078d3b2bc","RawContent":"Yes vistaprint is super quick that way!!!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1902132,"PostDate":1438979414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes vistaprint is super quick that way!!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.183.78.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79210,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"094893ea27a3efdd25a50ddafe208951","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"blissfulbride7\"] I love the pineapple design!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For others still looking, I found &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.orientaltrading.com\/large-navy-anchor-totes-a2-14_2071-18-0.fltr&#039;&gt;these&lt;\/a&gt; at Oriental Trading for only $1 each. There are plenty more on that site for around $1 as well. I am debating whether to do the anchor ones or design custom bags at discountmugs.com. Either way, I wouldn&#039;t put your initials\/names on the bags if you want people to use them again after the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902190,"PostDate":1439144830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283227\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283227-blissfulbride7\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">blissfulbride7<\/span><\/a> I love the pineapple design!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For others still looking, I found <a href='http:\/\/www.orientaltrading.com\/large-navy-anchor-totes-a2-14_2071-18-0.fltr' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>these<\/a> at Oriental Trading for only $1 each. There are plenty more on that site for around $1 as well. I am debating whether to do the anchor ones or design custom bags at discountmugs.com. Either way, I wouldn't put your initials\/names on the bags if you want people to use them again after the wedding.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffanyleewarren@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.14.41.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1429742931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tlwarren","Id":282831,"Name":"tlwarren","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.26.164.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79210,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45b0230547f6eda5efed2edc1518b2ff","RawContent":"@tlwarren- I ordered those anchor bags from Oriental Trading. I was surprised by how thin they are. I want my guests to be able to use the bags at the beach during the trip and they wouldn&#039;t be able to use these bags for that. They are great if you are just looking for a bag to use to present gifts, but not thick enough to use as a beach bag. The other caution that I think is mentioned in the review on the website, but the design is only on one side, the other side is plain blue.","Attachments":[],"Id":1902621,"PostDate":1439727241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @tlwarren- I ordered those anchor bags from Oriental Trading. I was surprised by how thin they are. I want my guests to be able to use the bags at the beach during the trip and they wouldn't be able to use these bags for that. They are great if you are just looking for a bag to use to present gifts, but not thick enough to use as a beach bag. The other caution that I think is mentioned in the review on the website, but the design is only on one side, the other side is plain blue.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lm_sprowl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.26.164.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418261031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cruisebride2016","Id":281378,"Name":"cruisebride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"4.26.24.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79210,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92c58d8e9abdfce622cf615e23d09185","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tlwarren\" post=\"1902190\" timestamp=\"1439159230\"]\n@[member=\"blissfulbride7\"] I love the pineapple design!\n\nFor others still looking, I found [url=\"http:\/\/www.orientaltrading.com\/large-navy-anchor-totes-a2-14_2071-18-0.fltr\"]these[\/url] at Oriental Trading for only $1 each. There are plenty more on that site for around $1 as well. I am debating whether to do the anchor ones or design custom bags at discountmugs.com. Either way, I wouldn&#039;t put your initials\/names on the bags if you want people to use them again after the wedding.[\/quote]\nDid you ever end up ordering these anchor bags? I bought these ones ([url=\"http:\/\/www.orientaltrading.com\/large-white-anchor-tote-bags-a2-14_2070.fltr?Ntt=anchor%20bag\"]http:\/\/www.orientaltrading.com\/large-white-anchor-tote-bags-a2-14_2070.fltr?Ntt=anchor%20bag[\/url]) and I love them! I didn&#039;t want to spend too much on them since I would be filling them with a lot of stuff, so they were perfect!","Attachments":[],"Id":1905326,"PostDate":1443088542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tlwarren, on 09 August 2015 - 06:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283227\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283227-blissfulbride7\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">blissfulbride7<\/span><\/a> I love the pineapple design!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For others still looking, I found <a href='http:\/\/www.orientaltrading.com\/large-navy-anchor-totes-a2-14_2071-18-0.fltr' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>these<\/a> at Oriental Trading for only $1 each. There are plenty more on that site for around $1 as well. I am debating whether to do the anchor ones or design custom bags at discountmugs.com. Either way, I wouldn't put your initials\/names on the bags if you want people to use them again after the wedding.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you ever end up ordering these anchor bags? I bought these ones (<a href='http:\/\/www.orientaltrading.com\/large-white-anchor-tote-bags-a2-14_2070.fltr?Ntt=anchor%20bag' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.orientalt...?Ntt=anchor bag<\/a>) and I love them! I didn't want to spend too much on them since I would be filling them with a lot of stuff, so they were perfect! <\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"softballchica48@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"4.26.24.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442488567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284847.jpg?_r=1444326998","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"sgleba25","Id":284847,"Name":"sgleba25","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.183.78.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79210,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by tlwarren, 24 September 2015 - 01:29 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1443101362,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4bc0a057c22fa7dc07be3defc12ae01d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@cruisebride2016&amp;nbsp; I just ordered the anchor bags the other day before I saw your comment about how thin they are! I read mixed reviews on the website, including some that said they are anchor on both sides and some saying just one side. I&#039;ll just have to see when they get here.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"sgleba25\"] I liked those bags too but I read reviews saying they were almost see-through; is that true?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905344,"PostDate":1443101327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@cruisebride2016\u00a0 I just ordered the anchor bags the other day before I saw your comment about how thin they are! I read mixed reviews on the website, including some that said they are anchor on both sides and some saying just one side. I'll just have to see when they get here.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284847\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284847-sgleba25\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sgleba25<\/span><\/a> I liked those bags too but I read reviews saying they were almost see-through; is that true?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffanyleewarren@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.14.41.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1429742931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tlwarren","Id":282831,"Name":"tlwarren","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.91.124.198","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79210,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb7bf15f0f08