g doing the same type of thing for my welcome letter.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.208.198.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03fab98197fe4a6262781e9fefdd3e4c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"khmciver\" post=\"1875737\" timestamp=\"1413335707\"]\n@[member=\"palmtree99\"] I got them on Etsy. The shop is called theHELLOtote. They&#039;re called Recovery Kit Mini Emergency Bags. They&#039;re really cute![\/quote]\nThank you, I really like them!","Attachments":[],"Id":1875793,"PostDate":1413373863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>khmciver, on 14 October 2014 - 09:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280304\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280304-palmtree99\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">palmtree99<\/span><\/a> I got them on Etsy. The shop is called theHELLOtote. They're called Recovery Kit Mini Emergency Bags. They're really cute!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you, I really like them!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cathyr99@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1412551851,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280304.jpg?_r=1412569727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"palmtree99","Id":280304,"Name":"palmtree99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.6.126.88","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a59ef9dd92fab8beb0cd15018b93c746","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love your bag toppers! I hadn&#039;t thought of a \"FBOW\" bag!! Looks like you had a lot of fun making them! I know your guests will enjoy them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875799,"PostDate":1413380623,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love your bag toppers! I hadn't thought of a \"FBOW\" bag!! Looks like you had a lot of fun making them! I know your guests will enjoy them!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Love over 50 is still LOVE!!!<\/p>\n<p>Invitations out! RSVPs in<\/p>\n<p>Us, them (bridal party), + 48 guests!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"dldincali@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.8.177.213","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399049737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277818.jpg?_r=1408642386","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":143,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VegasBride121314","Id":277818,"Name":"VegasBride121314","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efced0facd263a4140b57101f94cfa4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great ideas and inspiration! Thanks for sharing!!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope I didn&#039;t miss this if you posted already... But where did you find the mini Advil\/Tylenol?!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876000,"PostDate":1413557856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great ideas and inspiration! Thanks for sharing!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope I didn't miss this if you posted already... But where did you find the mini Advil\/Tylenol?!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#0066cc;\"><strong>- Jennifer and Fr<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>d<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>ric -<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>Playa del Carmen Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>December 1st, 2015<\/strong><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wedding@jennyfer.ca","IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413457548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280665.jpg?_r=1413805399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyZ","Id":280665,"Name":"JennyZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.80.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ea4f9a95826943136c630ef968d8843","RawContent":"@[member=\"JennyZ\"] thanks!! I got the medicines on Amazon. The provider was Mr. Medical. You can get them at staples for a good price too apparently. They&#039;re just little mini packets with 2 pills in them. I bought 50 packets for $14 I think.","Attachments":[],"Id":1876007,"PostDate":1413561618,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280665\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280665-jennyz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JennyZ<\/span><\/a> thanks!! I got the medicines on Amazon. The provider was Mr. Medical. You can get them at staples for a good price too apparently. They're just little mini packets with 2 pills in them. I bought 50 packets for $14 I think. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386793154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.94.52.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdc179db0d6576d0be4bdcd5eb45a07a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"khmciver\"] - Awesome! Thanks for your quick reply!!! I still have over a year to go, but making these bags are just too much fun, not to start planning right away! :lol: I already forsee myself buying way too much and having to pay for an extra suitcase, just to get everything down to Mexico ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876008,"PostDate":1413561921,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@khmciver - Awesome! Thanks for your quick reply!!! I still have over a year to go, but making these bags are just too much fun, not to start planning right away! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/> I already forsee myself buying way too much and having to pay for an extra suitcase, just to get everything down to Mexico <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#0066cc;\"><strong>- Jennifer and Fr<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>d<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>ric -<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>Playa del Carmen Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>December 1st, 2015<\/strong><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wedding@jennyfer.ca","IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413457548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280665.jpg?_r=1413805399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyZ","Id":280665,"Name":"JennyZ","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":63,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
