{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":847,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1897551,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279723,"Name":"lornj29","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1432943313,"LastPoster":{"Id":284300,"Name":"rahulthakur01","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1897551,"PostDate":1432943313,"PostContent":"Hi everyone!! Need some help. Ordered chair sashes thinking they were the right color but they we...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lornj29@aim.com","IpAddress":"68.192.37.147","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410094620,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lornj29","Id":279723,"Name":"lornj29","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.192.32.8","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79229,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4168ff7edc812cc2c4481a0a15592fbb","RawContent":"Hi everyone!! Need some help. Ordered chair sashes thinking they were the right color but they were not!! So now I need help finding the right color. The color of my bridesmaids \/ wedding color is a little different and hard to find matching colors for. It&#039;s called sea glass.. And it&#039;s not turquoise, not Aqua, not mint green... It&#039;s in between a bluish green color but I think it&#039;s more blue... I will attach the color what it&#039;s like. If anyone has any suggestions of where to find chair sashes that might be a close match I would appreciate it!!! All the colors I see are pretty much those turquoise, aqua colors which are too bright. I really would like to find a close match but it doesn&#039;t have to be exact!the candle\/ swatch is the color of the BM dress and the 2nd picture is a color I like but can&#039;t find!! Thanks!!!","Attachments":[{"Id":32454,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-279723-0-14117300-1432957562.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-279723-0-14117300-1432957562_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":32455,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-279723-0-97184200-1432957675.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-279723-0-97184200-1432957675_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":1136}],"Id":1897551,"PostDate":1432943313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone!! Need some help. Ordered chair sashes thinking they were the right color but they were not!! So now I need help finding the right color. The color of my bridesmaids \/ wedding color is a little different and hard to find matching colors for. It's called sea glass.. And it's not turquoise, not Aqua, not mint green... It's in between a bluish green color but I think it's more blue... I will attach the color what it's like. If anyone has any suggestions of where to find chair sashes that might be a close match I would appreciate it!!! All the colors I see are pretty much those turquoise, aqua colors which are too bright. I really would like to find a close match but it doesn't have to be exact!the candle\/ swatch is the color of the BM dress and the 2nd picture is a color I like but can't find!! Thanks!!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lornj29@aim.com","IpAddress":"68.192.37.147","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410094620,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lornj29","Id":279723,"Name":"lornj29","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.196.44.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79229,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddfd302fadf8a9bd8b58183d03605023","RawContent":"Hello - Beautiful color for the BMs dresses but I can see why it&#039;s a challenge. I&#039;m not sure where you live, or if you&#039;re open to making your own sashes, but Hobby Lobby usually has a large tulle color selection. You can probably buy regular white tulle anywhere and dye it too.\n\n\nIf the above is not an option, perhaps someone on Etsy will make them to your liking. Seems like anything is possible on Etsy!\n\n\nGood luck and keep us posted!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897563,"PostDate":1432968562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello - Beautiful color for the BMs dresses but I can see why it's a challenge. I'm not sure where you live, or if you're open to making your own sashes, but Hobby Lobby usually has a large tulle color selection. You can probably buy regular white tulle anywhere and dye it too.<br><br>\nIf the above is not an option, perhaps someone on Etsy will make them to your liking. Seems like anything is possible on Etsy!<br><br>\nGood luck and keep us posted!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421692870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79229,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by yycbride2016, 11 June 2015 - 04:54 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1434041679,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5287fbba2e1fef150c8c8cb41489f1da","RawContent":"@[member=\"lornj29\"] you have picked the same color as me! It&#039;s a super tricky color. I know! If you search for the teal you should be good. It goes either way as in sometimes more green and sometimes more blue. I just bought some sashes (50 sashes for $30cdn) on eBay and they were called teal blue. They won&#039;t get here for a few weeks though. \n\n\nI&#039;m still searching for my bridesmaids dresses but I only care if the dresses match the groomsmen&#039;s ties. The rest of my decor will be mixes of Aqua, turquoise, and teal. That way it won&#039;t be strange if one thing sticks out.  \n\nI&#039;ve attached. Picture of the sashes... \n\n\n\n teal blue sashes \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1898411,"PostDate":1434041659,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279723\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279723-lornj29\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lornj29<\/span><\/a> you have picked the same color as me! It's a super tricky color. I know! If you search for the teal you should be good. It goes either way as in sometimes more green and sometimes more blue. I just bought some sashes (50 sashes for $30cdn) on eBay and they were called teal blue. They won't get here for a few weeks though. <br><br>\nI'm still searching for my bridesmaids dresses but I only care if the dresses match the groomsmen's ties. The rest of my decor will be mixes of Aqua, turquoise, and teal. That way it won't be strange if one thing sticks out.  <br>\nI've attached. Picture of the sashes... <br><br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1898411]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283167-143405605262.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1434056051.699129.jpg - Size: 154.77KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283167-143405605262.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1434056051.699129.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n teal blue sashes <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432086904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.56.86.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79229,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"048593c9bedf43f4b00c26cd267a75ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279723-lornj29\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;lornj29&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Now that i&#039;m looking at your pictures on a computer... maybe our co